{"product_id":"mood-science-10-franny-k-stein-mad-scientist","title":"Mood Science (10) (Franny K. Stein, Mad Scientist)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFans of Goosebumps and Bill Nye the Science Guy will fall head over heels for Franny K. Stein, who is back with another laugh-out-loud experimental adventure in the tenth book in the Mad Scientist series.Franny K. Stein has had quite enough of her feelings getting in the way. So she physically removes them with the help of one of her machines.But it turns out that not having feelings can make things even worse, especially when you’ve accidentally released a virus that’s turning everybody into toads.Good thing she has the help of her grandma, Granny Fran, and her Sense of Duty to help her shake the apathy.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Benton Jim\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781534413436\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45677309329561,"sku":"5RC9781534413436","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/685ed1446c654_Mood_Science__10___Franny_K._Stein__Mad_Scientist__Benton_Jim.jpg?v=1756373518","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/mood-science-10-franny-k-stein-mad-scientist","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}